// ==========================================================================
// Bias - Closing
// Model folder: 09 - Lab / Bias Profile / Scores
// --------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Purpose: How far a model favours the closing touch.
// Why it exists: Fixed constants: a property of the model, not of the data.
// Declaring bias up front lets a ranking be challenged on the rule rather
// than the arithmetic.
// ==========================================================================

SWITCH(
    SELECTEDVALUE(CalculationGroupAttri[Name]),
    "First Touch", 0,
    "Last Touch",  100,
    "Linear",      33,
    "Time Decay",  50,
    "U Shape",     40,
    "W Shape",     30,
    BLANK()
)
